  "description": "Life is hard when you are different. That's what Elliot felt, being ostracized by his own family. But right when he no longer had anything to look forward in the future, he found himself lost in a new weird world different from his own home world, the Underland. In this new world where he's needed and loved (no matter how twisted the way they love him), Elliot had to fight for them to return the peace in the Underland although it will destroy both his body and soul...",
